==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*večerъ}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*wekʷsperos}}. Cognates include Ancient Greek {{m|grc|ἕσπερος}}, Latin {{m|la|vesper}}, Old Armenian {{m|xcl|գիշեր|}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|ве́чер}}
* {{audio|Ru-вечер.ogg|Audio|lang=ru}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|c|ве́чер|(1)|loc=вечеру́}}

# [[evening]] (after 8 PM)
# [[tonight]], this evening
#: {{ru-ux|Ве́чер обеща́ет быть прия́тным.|Tonight is going to be a pleasant night.|inline=y}}
# {{lb|ru|formal}} [[party]], [[social]] [[gathering]], [[soiree]]

